B.Zy=new A.ll("\ud83c\udfd1 Hockey","assets/images/hockey.jpeg","Playing as an attacker in my school and university hockey teams taught me teamwork, discipline, and resilience under pressure. I'm a proud representative of the Sri Lanka Universities Hockey Team, having competed at the Junior National Hockey Championship in both 2023 and 2024. I also played for the University of Moratuwa at the Sri Lanka University Games and Inter-University Games, earning University Colors in 2023, 2024, and 2025, for my performance and commitment to the sport.",!0,B.bV,null)
B.Zz=new A.ll("\ud83c\udfb5 Music","assets/images/music4.jpeg","Music has always been a big part of my life. As an instrumentalist, I've found a second voice through music. I play the clarinet in the Colombo Wind Orchestra and the Junior Symphony Orchestra, and I regularly perform for university events. My musical talents extend to the piano, drums, and violin, and I've also composed a few original pieces as I explore music. Music has been not just a passion but a way to express creativity and build community through performance.",!1,B.bV,null)
B.ZA=new A.ll("\ud83d\udc68\u200d\ud83c\udf93 Undergraduate","assets/images/uom.jpeg","I'm currently an undergraduate student in Electronic and Telecommunication Engineering at the University of Moratuwa, with a strong academic record (CGPA: 3.94/4.00) and a passion for engineering research. I actively contribute to both academic and extracurricular work from hands-on electronics projects to leadership roles in clubs and societies. I serve as the head of web in Electronics Club and was the president of the Mathematics Society.",!1,B.bV,null)
B.ZB=new A.ll("\ud83c\udfeb School Journey","assets/images/school.JPG","My foundation was laid at Visakha Vidyalaya, where I first developed a deep interest in both science and the arts. I was actively involved in prefects guilds, school band, hockey and montaineering teams, and societies. I served as the School Head Prefect and graduated with a strong academic and leadership record.",!0,B.bV,null)
